#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_653_yc9ldnx
msgid ""
"For each significant convertible bond issuance, inspect the bond agreement "
"to verify key terms, including principal amount, interest rate, maturity "
"date, conversion price, and conversion conditions."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_350_3n2y3uz
msgid ""
"For entities using the cost model, review for indicators of impairment, such"
" as adverse changes in market conditions or reduced rental income."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_348_y3c0tkq
msgid ""
"For entities using the fair value model, obtain valuation reports from "
"external appraisers and review the assumptions and methods used in "
"determining fair value."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_101_oxdc0y0
msgid ""
"For foreign currency derivatives, confirm that balances are translated using"
" the correct exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_151_b30jiq4
msgid ""
"For foreign currency prepayments, confirm that balances are translated at "
"the appropriate exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_11_hwwtdoq
msgid ""
"For foreign currency-denominated cash accounts, verify that year-end "
"balances are translated using the appropriate exchange rate."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_79_vaya8kl
msgid ""
"For foreign currency-denominated financial assets, verify that balances are "
"translated at the appropriate exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_35_jzi90vx
msgid ""
"For foreign currency-denominated receivables, verify that balances are "
"translated using the correct exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1018_hok063v
msgid ""
"For income earned close to the year-end, confirm that any accrued interest "
"is correctly recorded and that income is allocated to the appropriate "
"period."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_520_shoqwql
msgid ""
"For income tax payable, examine the income tax provision calculated as part "
"of the year-end tax provision process."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_947_ml1kuv5
msgid ""
"For industries with statutory minimum reserve requirements, verify that "
"retained earnings are sufficient to meet these requirements."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_741_8jqr7x7
msgid ""
"For instances of covenant non-compliance, inspect evidence of lender waivers"
" or amendments to confirm no violation of the loan terms."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_338_e34m1a0
msgid ""
"For intangible assets denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that "
"amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange"
" rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_334_3okrzpc
msgid ""
"For intangible assets generated internally (such as development costs), "
"verify that expenditures meet the criteria for capitalization."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_330_cwpqpug
msgid ""
"For intangible assets with indefinite useful lives, such as goodwill, review"
" the annual impairment test, including management’s assumptions and "
"supporting evidence."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_103_hccioga
msgid ""
"For interest rate derivatives, confirm that valuation considers prevailing "
"market interest rates and that changes in fair value are correctly "
"calculated."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_780_nsjd5el
msgid ""
"For interest-bearing long-term liabilities or those with accretion expense "
"(e.g., asset retirement obligations), review calculations to verify that "
"interest or accretion is recorded accurately."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_129_npbvsjt
msgid ""
"For inventory held on consignment, confirm that it is excluded from the "
"inventory balance and appropriately disclosed."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_223_q208xs1
msgid ""
"For investments in associates denominated in foreign currencies, confirm "
"that amounts are translated into the reporting currency at the appropriate "
"exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_185_3u95lhp
msgid ""
"For items classified as prepayments or deposits, confirm that they are being"
" amortized or expensed over the period of benefit."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_181_x2brsf3
msgid ""
"For items such as advances to suppliers or other receivables, assess the "
"likelihood of recovery by reviewing subsequent transactions and payment "
"history."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_711_gla4s2i
msgid ""
"For items where reversal may not occur (such as indefinite-lived "
"intangibles), confirm that deferred tax liabilities are appropriately "
"recognized based on tax regulations."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_240_01gafjv
msgid ""
"For joint ventures accounted under proportionate consolidation, confirm that"
" the appropriate share of joint venture assets, liabilities, income, and "
"expenses is included in the entity’s financial statements."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_239_mpk1vfd
msgid ""
"For joint ventures accounted under the equity method, verify adjustments for"
" the share of profits or losses and dividends received."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_245_hazg6iz
msgid ""
"For joint ventures denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that amounts "
"are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange rate as"
" of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_707_4xv0hiz
msgid ""
"For jurisdictions with future tax rate changes, verify that management has "
"applied the appropriate rates in line with the expected reversal period of "
"each temporary difference."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_315_8axuh6i
msgid ""
"For leases denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that amounts are "
"translated to the reporting currency at the correct exchange rate as of the "
"balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_762_qjmaju0
msgid ""
"For liabilities based on estimates, recalculate or independently verify the "
"amounts and confirm consistency with prior periods unless there is a "
"justified change in assumptions."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_769_h6hu1wq
msgid ""
"For liabilities based on management estimates, assess the reasonableness of "
"assumptions by comparing them to historical experience, industry data, or "
"actuarial recommendations."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_603_xwx0oab
msgid ""
"For loans secured by assets, review the details of the collateral "
"arrangement and confirm that assets pledged as collateral are properly "
"disclosed."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_782_nq4rvjr
msgid ""
"For long-term liabilities with covenant requirements, test compliance by "
"recalculating key ratios or thresholds and comparing them to covenant terms."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_376_fjjetzn
msgid ""
"For long-term receivables included in other non-current assets, review "
"credit assessments, payment history, and terms to determine recoverability."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_638_zrg28gr
msgid ""
"For new borrowings or repayments near the reporting date, inspect supporting"
" documents to confirm accurate cutoff in the financial statements."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_657_ssm7u7d
msgid ""
"For new issuances, test the calculation and allocation of debt and equity "
"components at the inception date of the bond in line with applicable "
"accounting standards."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_598_owthlow
msgid ""
"For new loans or repayments around year-end, inspect supporting "
"documentation to confirm that these transactions are accurately recorded in "
"the financial statements."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_147_x9o9n85
msgid ""
"For new prepayments acquired during the period, inspect supporting "
"documentation (e.g., vendor invoices, contracts) to verify the initial "
"recording and accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_391_8tsowls
msgid ""
"For non-responding confirmations, perform alternative procedures such as "
"reviewing subsequent cash disbursements or vendor statements."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_22_k9jicyb
msgid ""
"For non-responses, consider performing alternative procedures, such as "
"vouching to subsequent cash receipts or sales invoices."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_581_oq7l0sk
msgid ""
"For non-trade payables related to related parties, review the nature of the "
"transaction, confirm that it is appropriately recorded and disclosed, and "
"ensure it complies with applicable standards."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_207_rue7dp0
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables denominated in foreign currencies, verify that "
"amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the applicable exchange "
"rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_199_a8ojm0d
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables due from employees, related parties, or tax "
"authorities, review subsequent repayments or settlements to assess "
"recoverability."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_205_dmuxbkf
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables due from related parties, review board approvals "
"and confirm that terms are consistent with market rates."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_201_0y32ile
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables that accrue interest (e.g., loans to employees or "
"related parties), confirm that interest income is accurately calculated and "
"recorded."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_68_1cr6zq7
msgid ""
"For non-traded or complex financial assets, review management’s valuation "
"techniques and assumptions, or obtain independent valuation if available."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_187_jyohhuf
msgid ""
"For other current assets denominated in foreign currencies, verify that "
"amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange"
" rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_92_o1tcs88
msgid ""
"For over-the-counter (OTC) derivatives, review management’s valuation "
"methods, and consider reperforming the valuation or consulting with an "
"independent valuation specialist if necessary."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_461_b2z4h3l
msgid ""
"For overdrafts with continuous usage, evaluate the sustainability of cash "
"flow management and the entity's ability to reduce overdraft dependence."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_424_fl8qiaa
msgid ""
"For payroll and benefit-related accruals, review calculations and underlying"
" payroll data for accuracy and reasonableness."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_518_fw25zb6
msgid ""
"For payroll taxes payable, verify that payroll-related tax liabilities "
"(e.g., social security, Medicare, federal and state taxes) are accurately "
"calculated and recorded based on the payroll records."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_169_8tkpee5
msgid ""
"For prepaid taxes denominated in foreign currencies, verify that amounts are"
" translated to the reporting currency at the applicable exchange rate as of "
"the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_358_fk8npyg
msgid ""
"For properties denominated in foreign currencies, verify that amounts are "
"translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange rate at the"
" balance sheet date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_764_jhpra0t
msgid ""
"For provisions or obligations with future payments, recalculate present "
"values using appropriate rates and terms."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_480_mxidl30
msgid ""
"For provisions with significant management judgment (e.g., legal "
"contingencies, warranty claims), review the assumptions and estimates used "
"by management."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_67_ks4aqmx
msgid ""
"For publicly traded financial assets, obtain market prices as of the balance"
" sheet date from reliable sources to verify recorded fair values."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1037_9jaz6vg
msgid ""
"For rental income, obtain lease agreements and confirm that revenue "
"recognized is consistent with contract terms."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1041_mo57bsk
msgid ""
"For revenue transactions near the end of the reporting period, verify that "
"revenue is recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_808_tu27czw
msgid ""
"For shares issued or redeemed close to the year-end, verify the timing of "
"issuance or redemption against supporting documents to ensure accurate "
"period-end balances."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_628_1rwjsvg
msgid ""
"For significant covenants, obtain management's compliance assessment and "
"verify accuracy through recalculation or inspection of supporting documents."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_193_9nx3fdj
msgid ""
"For significant non-trade receivables, inspect supporting documentation, "
"such as loan agreements or employee advance forms, to verify the existence, "
"terms, and accuracy of recorded amounts."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_583_90c517z
msgid ""
"For significant or non-routine non-trade transactions (e.g., consulting "
"fees, legal settlements), obtain a copy of the contract or agreement to "
"confirm terms and verify the recorded liability."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_157_mq91v7f
msgid ""
"For significant prepaid tax items, obtain and inspect tax payment receipts, "
"and confirm the amounts and dates of payments."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_137_ebf8oju
msgid ""
"For significant prepayments (e.g., long-term insurance or rental contracts),"
" obtain confirmations or review supporting agreements to verify terms and "
"existence."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_893_75cj2k4
msgid ""
"For subsidiaries that distributed dividends to NCI holders, verify the "
"accuracy of the dividend calculation and ensure it aligns with the ownership"
" percentage."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_903_q5s0cml
msgid ""
"For subsidiaries with foreign operations, review foreign currency "
"translation adjustments included in OCI."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_425_cnfryqe
msgid ""
"For tax-related payables, verify calculations, obtain supporting tax returns"
" or filings, and ensure appropriate classification."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1020_t2k3bn0
msgid ""
"For variable-rate investments or loans, ensure that interest rate "
"adjustments are correctly applied, and income is accurately calculated based"
" on the adjusted rates."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_18_k7yg6y3
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_40_ea7yff7
